+The supported syntax is intentionally small and platform independent:
+
+* ``?`` matches exactly one character other than ``/``.
+* ``*`` matches any run of characters other than ``/``, including an empty run.
+* ``**`` may only be used as a complete path segment and matches zero or more
+  complete path segments.
+* ``[...]`` character classes support ranges and ``[!...]`` negation.
+* ``\`` escapes the following character.
+"""
